      "title": "Rekvina Laboratories Limited (BSE:526075) entered into agreement to acquire Radiant Parenterals Limited from Surbhit Mukesh Shah, Amit Mukesh Shah, Dhruvalkumar Patel, Krima Surbhit Shah and Ami Amit Shah for approximately INR 140 million.",
